|Admin|
:View user list;
stop

' ========================================
' 4. ADD USER ACTIVITY DIAGRAM
' ========================================
newpage
title Add User Activity Diagram

|Admin|
start
:Navigate to add user form;
:Enter user details;
:Submit form;

|System|
:Validate user data;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
    :Create user account in database;
    :Display success message;
    |Admin|
    :View confirmation;
    stop
else (no)
